# Test fixture photos. Personal images of identifiable people, kept local on purpose —
# `SubjectSegmentationDeviceTests.bigHead_onFixturePhotos` picks up whatever is in the folder and
# skips cleanly when it is empty, so CI and fresh clones are unaffected by their absence.
EnhanceTests/Fixtures/*
!EnhanceTests/Fixtures/README.md
